Vm(a,b,c,d,e){return"20 lines left to right, wins are based on the bet per line (bet \xf7 20). \u2b50 Sheriff is WILD. Above the reels there is a multiplier strip: every spin lands \xd71\u2026\xd715 and your whole line win is multiplied by it. \ud83d\udcdc anywhere: 3 \u2014 \xd7"+a+" of your bet and "+b+" free spins, 4 \u2014 "+c+", 5 \u2014 "+d+". In free spins the multiplier is at least \xd72, three \ud83d\udcdc give +"+e+" more."},
