ga8w(){return"Things are hard right now\u2026 | Terrible day, nothing is working out | I\u2019m tired of all this flipping"},
ga8y(){return"Happy birthday! Health, happiness and all the best! | Happy birthday! You\u2019re the best! | Happy birthday! Big hugs!"},
ga8C(){return"Happy Women\u2019s Day! Spring, smiles and warmth! | Happy March 8th! You\u2019re the best!"},
ga8z(){return"Happy Defender\u2019s Day! Health and strength! | Happy February 23rd! You\u2019re our rock"},
ga8A(){return"Happy New Year! May it all come true! | Happy New Year! More health and money!"},
ga9b(){return"Can I drop by today? | I\u2019ll be nearby \u2014 can I stop by for tea?"},
ga8R(){return"The cucumbers grew great this year \u2014 I sealed twenty jars. Come by and I\u2019ll give you some | Neighbour Valya is complaining about her blood pressure again. I tell her to watch less TV | I knitted you socks. Warm wool ones. You\u2019ll thank me in winter | Went to the clinic, sat in the queue half a day. But I chatted with everyone | Our cat Barsik brought a mouse again. Walks around proud, as if he sold a car"},
ga8U(){return"There\u2019s a new boss at work, a strict one. We\u2019ll see how it goes | Renovated the kitchen \u2014 new cupboards at last! | Signed up for yoga. It hurts for now, but I like it | Saw your old classmate, she asked about you. Everyone\u2019s grown up and busy | Making borscht and wondering \u2014 what are you eating there? Not just shawarma, I hope!"},
ga8V(){return"Replaced the fence at the dacha. Myself, with my own hands, no crews | Took the car in for service \u2014 they charged like for a new one. Wish I had your haggling skills | Went fishing with the guys. Caught a pike, this big | Watched football, ours lost again. As always | Thinking about re-roofing the garage, it leaks. Will do it in spring"},
ga8S(){return"Tinkered with my old Volga in the garage. It\u2019ll keep running, unlike today\u2019s plastic cars | Met up with my old army friends. Fewer of us every year, but we hold on | Reading the paper \u2014 prices went up again. In my day bread cost kopecks | Planted an apple tree. The grandkids will eat from it | Watched a show about cars. They say Japanese ones are reliable. Nonsense, ours are better"},
ga8W(){return"Bro, got new speakers in my car, the bass shakes the windows | Was at a party, so much fun! Next time I\u2019m inviting you | Thinking of getting into car flipping too. Will you teach me? | Saw a Supra in the neighbourhood yesterday. A beauty. When are you getting one? | Got a side job as a courier. My legs are killing me, but the money drips in"},
ga8X(){return"Passed my exams! Almost all good grades, can you imagine? | Started a blog about cats. A hundred followers already! | Had a fight with a friend over nothing. We\u2019ve already made up | I want to get my licence. Will you let me drive your car later? | Bought a dress, Mom says it was expensive. But I love it!"},
ga8T(){return"Was at a sanatorium \u2014 treatments, baths, wonderful! I recommend it to everyone | Have you heard the Petrovs\u2019 son is getting married? Everyone is invited to the wedding | Baked a Napoleon cake with a new recipe. The neighbours loved it | Utilities went up again. What is the world coming to | Watching a Turkish series, two hundred episodes. Can\u2019t tear myself away"},
ga8g(){return"Listen, you have an overdue loan payment. Debts first, everything else later | Banks don\u2019t forgive late payments: penalties pile up every week. At least make the payment"},
ga8j(){return"Cars on paid parking are money down the drain. Buy a garage or park in the yard | Paid parking eats your profit every hour. Think about a garage"},
ga8k(){return"Register the car on GosBuy, or you\u2019ll get a fine | Don\u2019t delay registering the car: ten days fly by"},
ga8f(){return"I heard you lost a lot at the casino. Quit it, it always ends in a loss | The casino always wins, not you. Better invest in cars"},
ga8l(){return"Your cars are just standing there \u2014 list at least one, let the money work | The garage is full but no listings. Buyers won\u2019t come on their own"},
ga8i(){return"Money is tight \u2014 don\u2019t take risks. Buy a cheap car, fix it up and sell | When you\u2019re broke, the main thing is to avoid debt. Start small"},
