Vj(a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h){return"Soldan sa\u011fa 20 hat, kazan\xe7lar hat ba\u015f\u0131na bahse g\xf6re (bahis \xf7 20). \u015eelale: kazanan semboller patlar, yenileri yukar\u0131dan d\xfc\u015fer \u2014 kazan\xe7 kalmayana kadar. \ud83c\udccf WILD, \ud83c\udf81 hari\xe7 her sembol\xfcn yerine ge\xe7er. \u015eelaleden sonra ekranda \ud83c\udf81: 3 \u2014 bahsin \xd7"+a+"\u2019\u0131 ve "+b+" bedava d\xf6n\xfc\u015f, 4 \u2014 \xd7"+c+" ve "+d+", 5 \u2014 \xd7"+e+" ve "+f+". Bedava d\xf6n\xfc\u015flerde her \u015fey \xd7"+g+", \xfc\xe7 \ud83c\udf81 "+h+" daha verir."},
