Vm(a,b,c,d,e){return"Soldan sa\u011fa 20 hat, kazan\xe7lar hat ba\u015f\u0131na bahse g\xf6re (bahis \xf7 20). \u2b50 \u015eerif WILD. Makaralar\u0131n \xfcst\xfcnde \xe7arpan \u015feridi var: her d\xf6n\xfc\u015fte \xd71\u2026\xd715 \xe7\u0131kar ve hat kazanc\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \xe7arpar. Her yerde \ud83d\udcdc: 3 \u2014 bahsin \xd7"+a+"\u2019\u0131 ve "+b+" bedava d\xf6n\xfc\u015f, 4 \u2014 "+c+", 5 \u2014 "+d+". Bedava d\xf6n\xfc\u015flerde \xe7arpan en az \xd72, \xfc\xe7 \ud83d\udcdc "+e+" daha verir."},
Vh(a,b){return"Soldan sa\u011fa 10 hat, kazan\xe7lar hat ba\u015f\u0131na bahse g\xf6re (bahis \xf7 10). \ud83d\udcd6 Kitap ayn\u0131 anda WILD ve bonus. Herhangi bir yerde 3 kitap \u2014 bahsin \xd7"+a+"\u2019\u0131 ve "+b+" bedava d\xf6n\xfc\u015f; bunlardan \xf6nce \xf6zel bir sembol se\xe7ilir. Bedava d\xf6n\xfc\u015flerde makaray\u0131 tamamen kaplar ve biti\u015fik olmasa bile t\xfcm hatlarda \xf6der (\ud83e\udd85 \ud83d\udc51 \ud83d\udc3a \u2014 iki makaradan, geri kalan\u0131 \u2014 \xfc\xe7 makaradan). \xdc\xe7 kitap "+b+" daha verir. \ud83e\udddf Y\xfcr\xfcyen mumya: bazen bir makaray\u0131 WILD olarak kaplar ve bedava tekrar d\xf6n\xfc\u015fler verir; her seferinde bir makara sola kayar, \u0131zgaradan \xe7\u0131kana kadar."},
